coach "Bend Don't Break"
about "Zone with everything kept in front: give up the short stuff, tackle it, and tighten up near the goal."

defense:
  when game ending and leading -> call "Prevent"
  when goal line within 5 -> call "Cover 1" or "Run Blitz"
  when third down and to go over 7 -> call "Cover 2" or "Prevent" or "Cover 3"
  otherwise -> call "Cover 3" or "Cover 2" or "Cover 3"

lineup:
  DL "Bull Rusher"
  LB "Coverage LB"
  CB "Ball Hawk"
  S "Center Fielder"
